OL,9,     Gfound healing, confidence and an
OL,10,     Gaudience she wasn't expecting.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 1999, seven people died in a
OL,13,     Gfire at the L'Amicale gaming
OL,14,     Ghouse in Port Louis, Mauritius.
OL,15,     GFour men were convicted of arson
OL,16,     Gamid claims of coercion and a
OL,17,     Gflawed investigation.
